The '''Administrator's Palace''' was a structure on [[Cloud City]], a floating colony located in the [[Life Zone|upper]] [[atmosphere]] of [[Bespin]]. It was the home of the [[city]]'s [[Baron Administrator]].<ref name="Battlefront" />

